 S, Froncek, D & Singgih, I 2017, 'Vertex magic total labelings of 2-regular graphs', Discrete Mathematics, vol. 340, no. 1, pp.\n\n# Vertex magic total labelings of 2-regular graphs\n\n  * Sylwia Cichacz\n  * , Dalibor Froncek\n  * , Inne Singgih\n\n  * Mathematics & Statistics\n\nResearch output: Contribution to journal › Article › peer-review\n\n24   Link opens in a new tab Scopus citations\n\n## Abstract\n\nA vertex magic total (VMT) labeling of a graph G = ( V, E ) is a bijection from the set of vertices and edges to the set of integers defined by λ : V ∪ E → { 1, 2, …, | V | + | E | } so that for every x ∈ V, w ( x ) = λ ( x ) + ∑ _{x y ∈ E} λ ( x y ) = k, for some integer k. A VMT labeling is said to be a super VMT labeling if the vertices are labeled with the smallest possible integers, 1, 2, …, | V |. In this paper we introduce a new method to expand some known VMT labelings of 2-regular graphs.\n\nOriginal language  | English (US)\nPages (from-to)  | 3117-3124\nNumber of pages  | 8\nJournal  | Discrete Mathematics\nVolume  | 340\nIssue number  | 1\nDOIs  | \n\n  * https://doi.org/10.1016/j.disc.2016.06.022\nState  | Published - Jan 6 2017\n\n## Keywords\n\n  * Magic-type labelings\n  * Vertex magic total labelings\n\n## Publisher link\n\n  * 10.1016/j.disc.2016.06.022\n\n## Cite this\n\n  * APA\n  * Standard\n  * Harvard\n  * Vancouver\n  * Author\n  * BIBTEX\n  * RIS\n\nCichacz, S., Froncek, D., & Singgih, I. (2017). Vertex magic total labelings of 2-regular graphs. Discrete Mathematics, 340(1), 3117-3124. https://doi.org/10.1016/j.disc.2016.06.022\n\nVertex magic total labelings of 2-regular graphs. / Cichacz, Sylwia; Froncek, Dalibor; Singgih, Inne.\nIn: Discrete Mathematics, Vol. 340, No. 1, 06.01.2017, p. 3117-3124.\n\nResearch output: Contribution to journal › Article › peer-review\n\nCichacz, S, Froncek, D & Singgih, I 2017, 'Vertex magic total labelings of 2-regular graphs', Discrete Mathematics, vol. 340, no. 1, pp. 3117-3124. https://doi.org/10.1